		description:
			"Returns the domain profiles and domain contacts in the authenticated user's domain directory.",
		context:
			"---\nname: listDirectoryPeople\ndescription: Returns the domain profiles and domain contacts in the authenticated user's domain directory.\n---\n\nLists the domain profiles and domain contacts of the authenticated user's Google Workspace\ndirectory. It requires a Workspace account — a consumer Google account has no directory.\n\nMerge sources pull extra data from the user's own contacts into a directory entry when the two\nare linked by a verified join key such as an e-mail address or phone number.\n\nPass `nextPageToken` back as the page token for the next page, and request a sync token to fetch only\nlater changes; entries removed since the last sync come back with `metadata.deleted` set.\n\nSee the [people.listDirectoryPeople reference](https://developers.google.com/people/api/rest/v1/people/listDirectoryPeople).",
		accounts: { google: { scope: ['https://www.googleapis.com/auth/directory.readonly'] } },
