			'Returns a list of other contacts, that is contacts that are not in a contact group.',
		context:
			'---\nname: listOtherContacts\ndescription: Returns a list of other contacts, that is contacts that are not in a contact group.\n---\n\nReturns the other contacts of the authenticated user — contacts that are not in any contact\ngroup, typically auto-created from interactions such as e-mail.\n\nThis call always requests the read mask `emailAddresses,metadata,names,phoneNumbers,photos`.\nThose five fields are what `READ_SOURCE_TYPE_CONTACT` returns, and they are the only person\nfields in the output. Selecting `Profile` together with `Contact` does not widen this mask.\nSelecting `Profile` on its own is not permitted.\n\nPagination and sync behave as in the contacts list: pass `nextPageToken` back as the page token, and\nrequest a sync token to fetch only later changes. Sync tokens expire 7 days after the full sync.\n\nSee the [otherContacts.list reference](https://developers.google.com/people/api/rest/v1/otherContacts/list).\n',
