		context:
			"---\nname: searchDirectoryPeople\ndescription: Returns the domain profiles and domain contacts in the authenticated user's domain directory that match a search query.\n---\n\nSearches the domain profiles and domain contacts of the authenticated user's Google Workspace\ndirectory. It requires a Workspace account — a consumer Google account has no directory.\n\nUnlike the directory listing, this method does not return a sync token; pass `nextPageToken` back as the\npage token to read further pages.\n\nSee the [people.searchDirectoryPeople reference](https://developers.google.com/people/api/rest/v1/people/searchDirectoryPeople).",
